  "notes": "The first window row represents a partly buried floor. The central stair windows sit between floor levels. The entrance has a deep rectangular surround with a projecting cap. Long-side bay counts and the rear access position are approximate. The owner exterior resolves fine subdivided sash, a projecting stone entrance cap and light sill and lintel stones. The rooftop trim and lower belt are separate courses."
